{"5100770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "At Once, My Lord!", "steam_appid": 5100770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At once, My Lord!</strong> is a cozy cleanup simulator with one simple goal: pick up every chunk of human (or not-so-human) remains and toss them into interdimensional recycling portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 21 different types of body parts to collect, plus a voodoo doll that's worth a whole lot more gold than your average severed limb. Spend your hard-earned gold on useful upgrades and turn a battlefield covered in carnage into a desolate wasteland... but a clean one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cozy Corpse Cleanup Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle of Kor'Vhar is over, and the entrance to Lord Shellborn's castle is absolutely littered with dismembered heroes who fought valiantly... or at least managed to throw a punch or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush. No pressure. Just picking up bits of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/79f3ef2c26ab250fb235baebfd1a9350.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/79f3ef2c26ab250fb235baebfd1a9350.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/79f3ef2c26ab250fb235baebfd1a9350.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well... there is <i>some</i> pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to clean everything up before dinner, Lord Shellborn himself may graciously decide to appear before you. And who knows? You might even earn yourself a promotion in this filthy pile of rocks and half-collapsed architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/607f409977856f3fc4e92672fdab399f.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/607f409977856f3fc4e92672fdab399f.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/607f409977856f3fc4e92672fdab399f.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect. Recycle. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've gathered an armful of assorted body parts, haul them over to an interdimensional recycling portal and cash them in for some gold. Where do all those heroic remains actually go? No idea. Not that anyone really cares... Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/f6b9c0dfe68b4a5c4074166c3eaa77ea.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/f6b9c0dfe68b4a5c4074166c3eaa77ea.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/f6b9c0dfe68b4a5c4074166c3eaa77ea.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Movement, Carrying Capacity, and Recycling Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful upgrades that let you move farther, better, and faster. Carry more body parts to the portal in a single trip and, well... unlock a few other things you'll discover as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/71cb73fe067c740c5c182db99be6503e.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/71cb73fe067c740c5c182db99be6503e.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/71cb73fe067c740c5c182db99be6503e.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Recycle over <strong>10,000 body parts</strong> scattered across Kor'Vhar<br>- Earn some cash for every chunk you toss into an interdimensional portal<br>- Unlock up to <strong>three recycling portals</strong> across the map, because walking is overrated<br>- Upgrade your abilities with up to <strong>15 upgrades and 4 special abilities</strong><br>- Relaxing and satisfying gameplay<br>- Watch the ground slowly become cleaner and cleaner... well, <i>emptier</i>, at least. The blood isn't going anywhere. That's just how it is.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At once, My Lord!</strong> is a cozy cleanup simulator with one simple goal: pick up every chunk of human (or not-so-human) remains and toss them into interdimensional recycling portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 21 different types of body parts to collect, plus a voodoo doll that's worth a whole lot more gold than your average severed limb. Spend your hard-earned gold on useful upgrades and turn a battlefield covered in carnage into a desolate wasteland... but a clean one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cozy Corpse Cleanup Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle of Kor'Vhar is over, and the entrance to Lord Shellborn's castle is absolutely littered with dismembered heroes who fought valiantly... or at least managed to throw a punch or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush. No pressure. Just picking up bits of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/79f3ef2c26ab250fb235baebfd1a9350.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/79f3ef2c26ab250fb235baebfd1a9350.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/79f3ef2c26ab250fb235baebfd1a9350.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well... there is <i>some</i> pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to clean everything up before dinner, Lord Shellborn himself may graciously decide to appear before you. And who knows? You might even earn yourself a promotion in this filthy pile of rocks and half-collapsed architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/607f409977856f3fc4e92672fdab399f.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/607f409977856f3fc4e92672fdab399f.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/607f409977856f3fc4e92672fdab399f.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect. Recycle. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've gathered an armful of assorted body parts, haul them over to an interdimensional recycling portal and cash them in for some gold. Where do all those heroic remains actually go? No idea. Not that anyone really cares... Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/f6b9c0dfe68b4a5c4074166c3eaa77ea.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/f6b9c0dfe68b4a5c4074166c3eaa77ea.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/f6b9c0dfe68b4a5c4074166c3eaa77ea.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Movement, Carrying Capacity, and Recycling Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful upgrades that let you move farther, better, and faster. Carry more body parts to the portal in a single trip and, well... unlock a few other things you'll discover as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/71cb73fe067c740c5c182db99be6503e.poster.avif?t=1788294528\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/71cb73fe067c740c5c182db99be6503e.webm?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/extras/71cb73fe067c740c5c182db99be6503e.mp4?t=1788294528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Recycle over <strong>10,000 body parts</strong> scattered across Kor'Vhar<br>- Earn some cash for every chunk you toss into an interdimensional portal<br>- Unlock up to <strong>three recycling portals</strong> across the map, because walking is overrated<br>- Upgrade your abilities with up to <strong>15 upgrades and 4 special abilities</strong><br>- Relaxing and satisfying gameplay<br>- Watch the ground slowly become cleaner and cleaner... well, <i>emptier</i>, at least. The blood isn't going anywhere. That's just how it is.</p>", "short_description": "The battle of Kor’Vhar is over. The heroes are gone, at least the ones who made it. Now someone has to clean up the mess... Guess who. Collect over 10,000 remains, toss them into the dimensional recycling container, earn Lord Shellborn’s respect, and maybe he’ll reveal himself.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/a7a93932728651a62b6ee28aa1fc2f9c79c2c60f/header.jpg?t=1788294528", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/7e7a756638e695d3a718939ee3cdcb1c72312efa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788294528", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5100770/7e7a756638e695d3a718939ee3cdcb1c72312efa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788294528", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790k / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 Ti 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 6500XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Who Makes Games"], "publishers": ["Who Makes Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categori